# Known bug: KI-36 - Ygra's static ability spans layers 4 and 6; once it has applied in layer 4 it goes on applying in layer 6 though Eaten by Piranhas takes it away (CR 613.6), and the engine drops its layer-6 part
# Eaten by Piranhas on Ygra herself: she loses all abilities in layer 6 and is a 1/1 black Skeleton creature. Her "Other
# creatures are Food artifacts ... and have '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this permanent: You gain 3 life'" has applied in layer 4
# before that (Bot2's Llanowar Elves are a Food artifact), and an effect that has started to apply in one layer goes on
# applying in the later ones "even if the ability generating the effect is removed during this process" (CR 613.6): the
# Elves still have the ability, and Bot2 activates it. Ygra's own "Whenever a Food ..." is gone, so she gets no counters.

